That was a cross-aligned altar and you need a co-aligned altar.
When you've level 5 and up you can do a sacrafice and have a
chance of converting the altar to Odin.  The higher your XP
the higher the chance.  But it will anger the priest and
priests are powerfull.  Angering a priest is a very bad move
unless you know all of the prices and know the tricks to make
it doable.  I will generally search the dungeon to level 10
before I decide to take out the minetown priest.

I the main dungeon there's a chance for an unprotected altar
on almost nay level so the deeper you go the higher the chance
of finding one.  It might start out co-aligned or you might
need to convert it.

The interesting things to do are #offer fresh corpses and
#pray when you are certain it is safe.  Each of the two have
different results.  For weapons there's only one you'll
get from prayer and it comes with other advantages and other
problems.  For weapons the change of an #offer getting one
starts low and goes lower as the number of artifacts you
have seen increases.  Figure a couple of dozen tries to
get your first, and it will be *well* worth your while.


